Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Opt-in (off by default) Automations card. An exported receiver accepts
com.noop.whoop.tasker.BUZZ addressed to this package, gated by a per-install
token (constant-time compare) and a cooldown, and repeats the hardware-confirmed
one-shot buzz 1-5 times. After every successful offload the app broadcasts
com.noop.whoop.tasker.SYNC_FINISHED with only synced_at and the strap battery,
no health data. Hooks: one line in the offload sink, one manifest receiver,
one Automations item; strings live in fork-only strings_victor.xml files.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
